# VisCode Technical Review V2 — Multi-Role Audit

> **Date**: 2026-05-14 | **Build**: Phase 1-4 Complete | **Tests**: 161 backend ✅  
> **Scope**: Full-stack audit — 15 backend files, 6 frontend files

---

## Review Panel

| Role | Focus Area |
