## Deployment Fix Priority

```
Phase A (30 min) — Get it running:
  ✅ Fix #1  SSE escaping          → main.py
  ✅ Fix #3  CSS import path       → index.html + main.js
  ✅ Fix #4  Delete stale files    → src/counter.js, src/style.css
  ✅ Fix #5  Vite config           → vite.config.js (new)
  ✅ Fix #7  API base URL          → api.js
  ✅ Fix #9  __init__.py files     → backend dirs

Phase B (30 min) — Make it usable:
  ✅ Fix #2  .env path blocking    → config.py + scanner.py
  ✅ Fix #6  Back navigation       → main.js
  ✅ Fix #8  Port conflict         → main.py
  ✅ Fix #13 .gitignore            → both .gitignore files

Phase C (1 hr) — Polish UI:
  ✅ Fix #11 Dagre layout          → canvas.js
  ✅ Fix #12 Error states          → main.js
  ✅ Fix #22 Model tier passthrough → orchestrator.py
  ✅ Fix #23 Canvas tooltips       → canvas.js
```

